            "sid": "ISA 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamafuku owu Merodaki Baladani, mwana kaBaladani, mwantawa kuBabiloni, hakutemesha nyikanda nichamukunkulu kudi Hezekiya, muloŋa watiyili nawu Hezekiya wadiŋi nakukata, nakoli dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiyawatiyili kuwaha nawena, hakuyileja itala dyuma yindi yalema, nisiliva, niwuru, ninyiseki, nimanji alema, niitala dejima dayitwa yindi, niyumayejima yamwenuwu kuyuma yindi yalema. Kwosi chuma chadiŋi mwitala dindi hela muwanta windi wejima chabulili kuyilejayi Hezekiyaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaprofwetu Isaya hakwinza kudi mwanta Hezekiya, hakumwihula nindi, Awaantu anahoshi nawudi? Chanenzuwu kudeyi anafumi kudihi? Hezekiya nindi, Anafumi kumpata yayilehi, kuBabiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena nindi, Mwitala deyi anamonumu yumanyi? Hezekiya nindi, Anamoni yuma yejima yidi mwitala dami; kwosi chuma chamuyuma yami yalema chinabuli kuyilejaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
